            <div xml:id="d691">

                <pb facs="0624" n="615" sameAs="frus:frus1940v02/pg615"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.8131/54: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Matthews</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Vichy</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1940-11-11T20:00:00+02:00">November 11,
                            1940—8 p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received November 12—9:08 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>934. Department’s 706, November 9, 10 p.m. I have informed Monick. He is leaving
                    to return to Morocco on Wednesday. He reiterated the need for haste as it seems
                    questionable how long a time he may have the requisite authority and
                    independence of action.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Matthews</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
